mutible (1.6.0-0) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * minicode is now mutible (https://mut.ible.ai). The source package and the
    app's package are named mutible; minicode is a transitional package that
    brings in mutible and can be removed.
  * The command is mutible, also installed as mbl, and as minicode, which
    starts mutible and says it has been renamed. The app id is now
    ai.ible.Mutible, so a launcher pinned to the dock under the old name
    has to be pinned again.
  * On its first launch mutible copies what minicode kept in
    ~/.config/minicode, ~/.local/state/minicode and ~/.local/share/minicode
    to the same folders named mutible, and leaves the old ones in place.
  * MINICODE_* environment variables are still read where the MUTIBLE_*
    name is not set.

 -- Eric Hansen <eric.calvin.hansen@gmail.com>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000

minicode (0~local-0) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Placeholder for a build straight from a checkout (dpkg-buildpackage -b),
    numbered below every real version so apt replaces it. scripts/ppa.sh
    writes the changelog for each upload in place of this one; see
    packaging/PPA.md.

